{
  "track": "COMMON",
  "milestones": [
    {
      "id": "LM_COMMON_REBORN_STOCK",
      "text": "你突然想起一支后来会涨很多的股票，这次你记得买了。",
      "delta": { "money": 12, "academics": 0, "career": 0, "wellbeing": 0 },
      "when": { "talentsAny": ["T_REBORN"] },
      "chancePermille": 400
    },
    {
      "id": "LM_COMMON_KID",
      "text": "家里多了一个小朋友，你的睡眠少了一半。",
      "delta": { "money": -6, "academics": 0, "career": -1, "wellbeing": 2 },
      "when": { "lifeFlagsAll": ["MARRIED"], "lifeFlagsNone": ["KID"] },
      "chancePermille": 150,
      "setFlags": ["KID"]
    },
    {
      "id": "LM_COMMON_MARRIED",
      "text": "你们领了证，婚礼上你只记得敬酒和那双磨脚的新鞋。",
      "delta": { "money": -6, "academics": 0, "career": 0, "wellbeing": 6 },
      "when": { "lifeFlagsAll": ["DATING"], "lifeFlagsNone": ["BREAKUP", "MARRIED"] },
      "chancePermille": 220,
      "setFlags": ["MARRIED"]
    },
    {
      "id": "LM_COMMON_MARRIED_AGAIN",
      "text": "兜兜转转，你们决定结婚，请柬上的照片拍了两百张才选好。",
      "delta": { "money": -6, "academics": 0, "career": 0, "wellbeing": 6 },
      "when": { "lifeFlagsAll": ["CM_DATING_AGAIN"], "lifeFlagsNone": ["MARRIED"] },
      "chancePermille": 220,
      "setFlags": ["MARRIED"]
    },
    {
      "id": "LM_COMMON_DATE_AGAIN_LOOKS",
      "text": "分手没多久，就有人鼓起勇气约你看电影，你答应了。",
      "delta": { "money": -1, "academics": 0, "career": 0, "wellbeing": 6 },
      "when": { "talentsAny": ["T_GOOD_LOOKING"], "lifeFlagsAll": ["BREAKUP"], "lifeFlagsNone": ["MARRIED", "CM_DATING_AGAIN"] },
      "chancePermille": 300,
      "setFlags": ["CM_DATING_AGAIN"]
    },
    {
      "id": "LM_COMMON_DATE_AGAIN",
      "text": "朋友介绍了一个人，你们聊得来，你又有了对象。",
      "delta": { "money": -1, "academics": 0, "career": 0, "wellbeing": 6 },
      "when": { "talentsNone": ["T_GOOD_LOOKING"], "lifeFlagsAll": ["BREAKUP"], "lifeFlagsNone": ["MARRIED", "CM_DATING_AGAIN"] },
      "chancePermille": 150,
      "setFlags": ["CM_DATING_AGAIN"]
    },
    {
      "id": "LM_COMMON_BREAKUP",
      "text": "你们和平分手了，共同好友的群里安静了好几天。",
      "delta": { "money": 0, "academics": 0, "career": 1, "wellbeing": -8 },
      "when": { "lifeFlagsAll": ["DATING"], "lifeFlagsNone": ["MARRIED", "BREAKUP"] },
      "chancePermille": 170,
      "setFlags": ["BREAKUP"]
    },
    {
      "id": "LM_COMMON_DATING_LOOKS",
      "text": "你在朋友圈发了张自拍，评论区有人开始认真追你，三个月后成了你的对象。",
      "delta": { "money": -2, "academics": 0, "career": 0, "wellbeing": 6 },
      "when": { "talentsAny": ["T_GOOD_LOOKING"], "lifeFlagsNone": ["DATING", "MARRIED"] },
      "chancePermille": 300,
      "setFlags": ["DATING"]
    },
    {
      "id": "LM_COMMON_DATING",
      "text": "朋友组局时坐你旁边的那个人，后来成了你的对象。",
      "delta": { "money": -2, "academics": 0, "career": 0, "wellbeing": 6 },
      "when": { "talentsNone": ["T_GOOD_LOOKING"], "lifeFlagsNone": ["DATING", "MARRIED"] },
      "chancePermille": 150,
      "setFlags": ["DATING"]
    },
    {
      "id": "LM_COMMON_FIRE",
      "text": "你算了算余额，发现这辈子可以不上班了，但还是每天七点醒。",
      "delta": { "money": 0, "academics": 0, "career": -2, "wellbeing": 6 },
      "when": { "lifeFlagsAll": ["STARTUP_EXIT"], "lifeFlagsNone": ["FIRE"], "statMin": { "money": 70 }, "yearMin": 3 },
      "chancePermille": 400,
      "setFlags": ["FIRE"]
    },
    {
      "id": "LM_COMMON_STARTUP_EXIT",
      "text": "公司被一家大厂收购了，你签完字，在楼下坐了很久。",
      "delta": { "money": 12, "academics": 0, "career": 6, "wellbeing": 4 },
      "when": { "lifeFlagsAll": ["STARTUP"], "lifeFlagsNone": ["STARTUP_EXIT", "CM_STARTUP_DEAD"] },
      "chancePermille": 100,
      "setFlags": ["STARTUP_EXIT"]
    },
    {
      "id": "LM_COMMON_STARTUP_FAIL",
      "text": "钱烧完了，公司解散，最后一台显示器被员工折价买走了。",
      "delta": { "money": -8, "academics": 0, "career": 2, "wellbeing": -6 },
      "when": { "lifeFlagsAll": ["STARTUP"], "lifeFlagsNone": ["STARTUP_EXIT", "CM_STARTUP_DEAD"] },
      "chancePermille": 300,
      "setFlags": ["CM_STARTUP_DEAD"],
      "setTrack": "TRANSITION"
    },
    {
      "id": "LM_COMMON_STARTUP_HACK",
      "text": "黑客松上随手做的项目有人要投钱，你注册了一家公司。",
      "delta": { "money": -4, "academics": 0, "career": 4, "wellbeing": -2 },
      "when": { "talentsAny": ["T_HACKATHON"], "tracks": ["LOCAL_JOB", "HOME_JOB", "TRANSITION", "DROPOUT"], "lifeFlagsNone": ["STARTUP", "CIVIL_SERVANT"], "statMin": { "career": 55 } },
      "chancePermille": 60,
      "setFlags": ["STARTUP"]
    },
    {
      "id": "LM_COMMON_STARTUP",
      "text": "你和朋友注册了一家公司，你是 CEO，也是客服和保洁。",
      "delta": { "money": -4, "academics": 0, "career": 4, "wellbeing": -2 },
      "when": { "talentsNone": ["T_HACKATHON"], "tracks": ["LOCAL_JOB", "HOME_JOB", "TRANSITION", "DROPOUT"], "lifeFlagsNone": ["STARTUP", "CIVIL_SERVANT"], "statMin": { "career": 55 } },
      "chancePermille": 30,
      "setFlags": ["STARTUP"]
    },
    {
      "id": "LM_COMMON_INFLUENCER_NET",
      "text": "你随手发的一条视频火了，一夜之间多了好几万粉丝。",
      "delta": { "money": 2, "academics": 0, "career": 3, "wellbeing": 3 },
      "when": { "talentsAny": ["T_NET_SENSE"], "lifeFlagsNone": ["INFLUENCER"] },
      "chancePermille": 60,
      "setFlags": ["INFLUENCER"]
    },
    {
      "id": "LM_COMMON_INFLUENCER",
      "text": "你坚持更新了一年视频，粉丝终于过了一万。",
      "delta": { "money": 2, "academics": 0, "career": 3, "wellbeing": 3 },
      "when": { "talentsNone": ["T_NET_SENSE"], "lifeFlagsNone": ["INFLUENCER"] },
      "chancePermille": 30,
      "setFlags": ["INFLUENCER"]
    },
    {
      "id": "LM_COMMON_SIDE_HUSTLE",
      "text": "你开始在周末帮学弟学妹改申请文书，口碑全靠录取结果。",
      "delta": { "money": 5, "academics": 0, "career": 0, "wellbeing": -3 },
      "when": { "tracks": ["LOCAL_JOB", "PHD", "DROPOUT"], "lifeFlagsNone": ["SIDE_HUSTLE"] },
      "chancePermille": 40,
      "setFlags": ["SIDE_HUSTLE"]
    },
    {
      "id": "LM_COMMON_CAT",
      "text": "楼下的流浪猫跟你回了家，从此家里它说了算。",
      "delta": { "money": -2, "academics": 0, "career": 0, "wellbeing": 6 },
      "when": { "lifeFlagsNone": ["PET"] },
      "chancePermille": 50,
      "setFlags": ["PET", "CM_CAT"]
    },
    {
      "id": "LM_COMMON_DOG",
      "text": "你领养了一只狗，从此每天早上六点被准时叫醒。",
      "delta": { "money": -3, "academics": 0, "career": 0, "wellbeing": 6 },
      "when": { "lifeFlagsNone": ["PET"] },
      "chancePermille": 25,
      "setFlags": ["PET", "CM_DOG"]
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "id": "LE_COMMON_REUNION_WECHAT",
      "text": "同学会上大家互加了微信，然后再也没说过话。",
